{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>At the end of ten years.</b> Our earlier Sages, of blessed memory, decreed that a man should not remain with his wife more than ten years if she does not give birth, and this verse is like an asmakhta, and it is good."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:44:44.106368406Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}